        "pf_9d998048_value": "LIMITED WARRANTY: Kessick warrants the high quality and\rusability of the <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WinePanel</span>™ System and <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WineWall</span>™ System\r(the “Products”) for the extent of the Product’s life. This service\rprotects against any defects in materials or workmanship\rperformed by Kessick. Should a defect arise, contact us\rimmediately. “Defect” refers to, but is not limited to, occurrences of warping and bowing, splitting, or cracking of the of the\rbase-panel, as well as delamination of top panel or edge\rbanding. Kessick will replace the defective part or send a\rfull replacement.<br><br>Customer is responsible for notifying Kessick of defects\rbelieved to be covered by this Warranty within 10 days of\rreceiving the product. We reserve the right to inspect any\ritem for product failure and may request photographs of or\rthe return of the product. This Warranty is limited to the cost\rof repair or replacement of the defective item. It is advisable\rto inspect the Products once you have received them for\rany signs of defects in the Products themselves and the\rKessick-supplied hardware.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">What is Not Covered</span><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deterioration\ror malfunction resulting from the Customer’s handling or\rinstallation of the Products, or the removal of the Products\rfrom any installation, any unauthorized tampering with the\rProducts, any repairs attempted by anyone unauthorized\rby Kessick to make such repairs, or any other cause that\rdoes not relate directly to a defect in materials and/or\rworkmanship of the Products.<br><br>This limited warranty does not cover any damage, deterioration\ror malfunction resulting from any alteration, modification,\rimproper or unreasonable use or maintenance, misuse,\rabuse, accident, neglect, exposure to excess moisture, fire,\rlightning, power surges, or other acts of nature.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Who is Covered</span><br>Only the original purchaser of the Products is covered under\rthis limited warranty. This limited warranty is not transferable\rto subsequent purchaser or owners of the Products.<br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><br>How Kessick Will Help</span><br>Kessick will, at its sole discretion, provide one of the following\rthree remedies to whatever extent it shall deem necessary to\rsatisfy a proper claim under this limited warranty: 1. Elect to\rrepair or facilitate the repair of any defective parts within\ra reasonable period of time, free of any charge for the\rnecessary parts and labor to complete the repair and restore this product to its proper operating condition. Kessick will\ralso pay the shipping costs necessary to return this product\ronce the repair is complete. 2. Replace this product. 3. Issue\ra refund of the original purchase price less depreciation to\rbe determined based on the age of the product at the time\rremedy is sought under this limited warranty.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Obtaining a Remedy under this Limited Warranty</span><br>To obtain a remedy under this limited warranty, you must\reither contact the authorized Kessick distributor or our\roffices directly at sales@kessick.com. The return form must\ralso be filled out and returned with the product. This product\rshould be properly packed, preferably in the original carton,\rfor shipping.",
        "pf_56906436_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">INSTALLATION</span>: Kessick Wine Storage Systems, LLC (“Kessick”)\rdirects you our customer (“Customer”) to the Installation\rGuide and Installation Video included on our website\r(www.wineasaert.com) for your new Kessick <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WinePanel</span>™\rSystem or <span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WineWall</span>™ System. The Installation Guide and\rInstallation Video are for informational use only and shall not\rbe regarded as a warranty. It is imperative that the installer\rof your new Kessick Wine Panel System or Wine Wall System\rreview and understand the specifications and logistics\runique to the Customer’s chosen location for installation, as\rwell as the written instructions in the Installation Guide and\rthe Installation Video prior to beginning installation. It is the\rresponsibility of the installer to understand the installation\rinstructions contained within the Installation Guide and\rInstallation Video, or to obtain clarification of the installation\rinstructions, prior to beginning the installation process, and\rto follow all applicable local building codes.\r<br><br>The Wine Panel System and Wine Wall System have been\rdesigned and engineered to securely fasten a back-panel to a\r<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">wood framed structural wall</span> (gypsum board over wood 2x4,\rtypical) and to support the weight of the finished panel with\rthe Kessick-supplied wine bottle hardware and a “live load” of\rwine bottles, at a maximum weight of 3lbs per wine bottle.",
        "pf_b4563739_value": "<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WineWall</span>™ System: The Wine Panel back-panel should\rbe installed directly into a vertical wall surface with the\rKessick-supplied wood screws into a wood framing\rstructure. The Wine Wall System requires a minimum\rof 3 wood screws for every 14” x 14” area (i.e., 42”x\r42” – 18 wood screws into wall studs). <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">*Hollow wall\ranchors are not acceptable fasteners for installation\rof the Wine Wall System and are NOT TO BE USED\rin installation of the Wine Wall System. Metal wall\rstuds are not suitable for installation unless sheathed\rwith  ” –  ” plywood.</span> * Kessick strongly advises the\rCustomer to engage a licensed professional to install\rthe Wine Wall System into any non-wood framed (i.e.,\rmasonry, brick, block, concrete, stone) structures.<br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">WARNING: IMPROPER INSTALLATION OF THE\rWINE WALL SYSTEM (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED\rTO THE USE OF HOLLOW WALL ANCHORS, OR\rMETAL WALL STUDS UNSHEATHED TO  ” –  ”\rPLYWOOD, OR FAILURE TO FOLLOW THE\rINSTALLATION GUIDE OR INSTALLATION VIDEO)\rMAY RESULT IN SERIOUS PERSONAL INJURY.\rINSTALLATION OF THE WINE WALL SYSTEM\rINTO ANY STRUCTURE OTHER THAN WOODFRAMING,\rINCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO\rMASONRY, BRICK, BLOCK, CONCRETE, OR\rSTONE, SHOULD BE PERFORMED BY A LICENSED\rPROFESSIONAL ONLY.</span>",
        "pf_f6afcec0_value": "<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Disclaimer of Liability</span><br>Kessick disclaims liability for incidental or consequential\rdamages and assumes no responsibility or liability for any\rloss or damage suffered by any person as a result of the use\ror misuse of any of any of its products, or the installation or\rhandling of its products.\r<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Limitation on Liability</span><br>KESSICK’S MAXIMUM LIABILITY UNDER THIS LIMITED\rWARRANTY SHALL NOT EXCEED THE ACTUAL PURCHASE\rPRICE PAID FOR THE PRODUCT. TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT\rPERMITTED BY LAW, KESSICK IS NOT RESPONSIBLE FOR\rDIRECT, SPECIAL, INCIDENTAL OR CONSEQUENTIAL\rDAMAGES RESULTING FROM ANY BREACH OF WARRANTY\rOR CONDITION, OR UNDER ANY OTHER LEGAL THEORY.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Exclusive Remedy</span><br>TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, THIS\rLIMITED WARRANTY AND THE REMEDIES SET FORTH\rABOVE ARE EXCLUSIVE AND IN LIEU OF ALL OTHER\rWARRANTIES, REMEDIES AND CONDITIONS, WHETHER\rORAL OR WRITTEN, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. TO THE MAXIMUM\rEXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, KESSICK SPECIFICALLY\rDISCLAIMS ANY AND ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES.\r<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Questions?</span><br>Please contact Customer Support at sales@kessick.com.",
        "pf_dbaee5f1_value": "We hope you are in love with your new Wine as Art wine wall or wine panel. However, we know things happen from time to time, so please review the return policy below.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Shipping Damage</span>:  Please take a photo of the damaged package and any damage to the panel(s) and email us the photo along with the order number. We will assess the damage to determine what pieces need to be replaced.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Mistake in the Order</span>:  We work hard to ensure your order is correct, but if there is an error or a discrepancy, we will make it right! Please contact us so we can determine the best course of action. We will correct the mistake or issue a full refund, including shipping.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Changed Your Mind</span>: We accept returns within 30 days of receipt. Items must be unused and returned in the original packaging. Because we make each panel to order, a restocking fee of 30% will be assessed. Custom orders are not eligible for return.<br><br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Questions</span>:  Please contact us at sales@kessick.com.\n",
        "pf_a5f933b4_value": "<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">WinePanel</span>™ System: The Wine Panel System is designed for installation of the back-panel directly to a vertical wall surface, using the Kessick-supplied wood screws, into a <span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">wood framing structure</span>. If a wood framing structure is not available, “hollow wall anchors” can be used. Refer to the hollow wall anchors manufacturer’s instruction for proper and safe application. To that end, Kessick strongly advises the Customer to engage a licensed professional to install the Wine Panel System into any non-wood framed structure. <br><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">WARNING: IMPROPER INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM (INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO FAILURE TO FOLLOW THE INSTALLATION GUIDE OR INSTALLATION VIDEO) MAY RESULT IN SERIOUS PERSONAL INJURY. INSTALLATION OF THE WINE PANEL SYSTEM INTO ANY STRUCTURE\rOTHER THAN WOOD-FRAMING (INCLUDING\rBUT NOT LIMITED TO MASONRY, BRICK, BLOCK,\rCONCRETE, OR STONE) SHOULD BE PERFORMED\rBY A LICENSED PROFESSIONAL ONLY.</span>",
        "pf_ae0b80a8_value": "<span style=\"font-style: italic;\">Kessick LLC is committed to high quality products and great customer service. It is our desire to have satisfied\ncustomers that enjoy their Kessick wine storage system and are pleased with the aesthetics and function as well\nas the installation process. Kessick Wine As Art products have been designed and engineered to enable the best\npossible customer experience.</span>",
        "pf_c6b57914_value": "All wine panels and wine walls are made to order and will typically ship in 1-2 weeks. Custom orders ship in 4-6 weeks. We will communicate promptly if there will be a delay in shipping. We ship via UPS and cannot ship to a P.O. Box.",
